{
  "id": "shz01-vo-01",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "V01",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "如果有一天，你要亲手签下一封休书，给你最爱的人。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V01.mp3",
      "bytes": 84470,
      "heard": "如果有一天,你要親手簽下一封修書給你最愛的人。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 5.2
    },
    {
      "name": "V02",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "她哭着问你：我清清白白，你为什么不要我？",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V02.mp3",
      "bytes": 75275,
      "heard": "他哭着问你 我轻轻白白 你为什么不要我",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.969,
      "seconds": 4.64
    },
    {
      "name": "V03",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你说不出口——你是怕自己回不来，误了她一辈子。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V03.mp3",
      "bytes": 79037,
      "heard": "你說不出口,你是怕自己回不來誤了他一輩子。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 4.88
    },
    {
      "name": "V04",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "可这一别，就是一辈子。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V04.mp3",
      "bytes": 44764,
      "heard": "可这一别就是一辈子",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.72
    },
    {
      "name": "V05",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "这个人，叫林冲。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V05.mp3",
      "bytes": 34315,
      "heard": "这个人叫林聪",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "name": "V06",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你本来什么都有：八十万禁军教头，一身本事。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V06.mp3",
      "bytes": 76529,
      "heard": "你本来什么都有八十万禁军教头一身本事",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.72
    },
    {
      "name": "V07",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "家里的娘子，成亲三年，没跟你红过一次脸。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V07.mp3",
      "bytes": 70260,
      "heard": "家里的娘子成亲三年没跟你红过一次脸",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 4.32
    },
    {
      "name": "V08",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你只想，日子就这样过下去。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V08.mp3",
      "bytes": 53541,
      "heard": "你只想日子就這樣過下去",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.28
    },
    {
      "name": "V09",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "直到那天在岳庙，有人当众调戏她。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V09.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "直到那天在月廟有人當眾調戲他",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "V10",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你一把扳过那人，拳头举了起来——",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V10.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "你一把班过那人 拳头举了起来",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "V11",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "却认出，那是你上司的干儿子。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V11.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "卻認出那是你上司的乾兒子",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "name": "V12",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "拳头，软了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V12.mp3",
      "bytes": 38077,
      "heard": "拳头软了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 2.32
    },
    {
      "name": "V13",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你忍了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V13.mp3",
      "bytes": 20105,
      "heard": "你忍了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.968,
      "seconds": 1.2
    },
    {
      "name": "V14",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "最好的朋友陆谦，帮着他们害你，",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V14.mp3",
      "bytes": 53541,
      "heard": "最好的朋友陸謙幫著他們害你",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.28
    },
    {
      "name": "V15",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你忍了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V15.mp3",
      "bytes": 20105,
      "heard": "你忍了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.977,
      "seconds": 1.2
    },
    {
      "name": "V16",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "被诬陷，脸上刺字，发配沧州，",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V16.mp3",
      "bytes": 63990,
      "heard": "被诬陷,脸上刺字,发配苍州。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "name": "V17",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你还是忍了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V17.mp3",
      "bytes": 26792,
      "heard": "你还是忍了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 1.6
    },
    {
      "name": "V18",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你总觉得，忍一忍，就能回去。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V18.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "你总觉得忍一忍就能回去",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "V19",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "岳父也说：放你回来时，依旧夫妻完聚。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V19.mp3",
      "bytes": 82798,
      "heard": "岳父也说,放你回来时依旧夫妻玩具。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 5.12
    },
    {
      "name": "V20",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "到了沧州，你守着一座草料场。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V20.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "到了苍州,你守着一座草料厂。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "V21",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "那年冬天，雪下得特别大。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V21.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "那年冬天雪下的特别大",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "V22",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "雪压塌了草屋，你躲进山神庙，搬石头抵住了门。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V22.mp3",
      "bytes": 86978,
      "heard": "血壓塌了草屋,你躲進山神廟,搬石頭抵住了門。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 5.36
    },
    {
      "name": "V23",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "半夜，草料场烧起来了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V23.mp3",
      "bytes": 41838,
      "heard": "半夜草料厂烧起来了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 2.56
    },
    {
      "name": "V24",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "门外有人说：烧死了，拾他一两块骨头回去交差。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V24.mp3",
      "bytes": 77783,
      "heard": "门外有人说 烧死了 使他一两块骨头回去交差",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.8
    },
    {
      "name": "V25",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "那个声音，你认得。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V25.mp3",
      "bytes": 35569,
      "heard": "那个声音你认得",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.993,
      "seconds": 2.16
    },
    {
      "name": "V26",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你终于明白，",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V26.mp3",
      "bytes": 24284,
      "heard": "你终于明白",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.993,
      "seconds": 1.44
    },
    {
      "name": "V27",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "忍，是回不去的。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V27.mp3",
      "bytes": 38077,
      "heard": "人是回不去的",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.993,
      "seconds": 2.32
    },
    {
      "name": "V28",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你推开了门。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V28.mp3",
      "bytes": 21358,
      "heard": "你推开了门。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 1.28
    },
    {
      "name": "V29",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "那一夜雪越下越大，你一个人，上了梁山。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V29.mp3",
      "bytes": 80291,
      "heard": "那一夜雪越下越大你一個人上了梁山",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "name": "V30",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你想把娘子接上山，可这件事，一拖再拖。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V30.mp3",
      "bytes": 76529,
      "heard": "你想把娘子接上山,可這件事一拖再拖。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.72
    },
    {
      "name": "V31",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "等派去的人回来，只带回一句话：",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V31.mp3",
      "bytes": 51034,
      "heard": "等派去的人回来只带回一句话",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "name": "V32",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "娘子被逼，自缢身死，已故半载。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V32.mp3",
      "bytes": 69006,
      "heard": "娘子被逼自异身死 已故伴宰",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 4.24
    },
    {
      "name": "V33",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你哭了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V33.mp3",
      "bytes": 18851,
      "heard": "你哭了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.907,
      "seconds": 1.12
    },
    {
      "name": "V34",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "从此，心里再没有可挂念的人。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V34.mp3",
      "bytes": 53541,
      "heard": "從此心裡再沒有可掛念的人",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 3.28
    },
    {
      "name": "V35",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "后来，仇人高俅被捉上山，又被好酒好肉送了回去。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V35.mp3",
      "bytes": 86978,
      "heard": "後來仇人高球被桌上山又被好酒好肉送了回去",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 5.36
    },
    {
      "name": "V36",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "再后来，你病倒在杭州六和寺，再没起来。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V36.mp3",
      "bytes": 77783,
      "heard": "再后来你病倒在杭州六河寺再没起来",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.8
    },
    {
      "name": "V37",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你这一辈子，都在等那句：依旧夫妻完聚。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V37.mp3",
      "bytes": 80291,
      "heard": "你這一輩子都在等那句,依舊夫妻玩具。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "name": "V38",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "如果重来一次，岳庙那一拳，你打不打？",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V38.mp3",
      "bytes": 61065,
      "heard": "如果重来一次 月庙那一拳 你打不打",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.76
    },
    {
      "name": "V32b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "娘子被逼，自缢身死，已故半宰。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "V32b.mp3",
      "bytes": 67752,
      "heard": "娘子被逼,自一生死,以故伴宰。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
